  "instructions": [
    "Mix 1 tbsp olive oil, the garlic, paprika, cumin, 1 tsp salt, and the pepper in a small bowl. Rub it all over the flank steak and let it sit while the grill heats.",
    "Heat an outdoor grill or grill pan to medium-high, about 450 F. Brush the grates lightly with oil if needed.",
    "Brush the corn and zucchini with the remaining 2 tbsp oil. Sprinkle the vegetables with the remaining 1/2 tsp salt.",
    "Grill the corn for 10 to 12 minutes, turning every 3 minutes, until browned in spots and tender.",
    "Grill the steak for 4 to 6 minutes per side. Cook until a thermometer in the thickest part reads 145 F.",
    "Grill the zucchini cut side down for 3 to 4 minutes per side, until tender with dark grill marks.",
    "Rest the steak on a board for 5 minutes. Slice it thinly across the grain.",
    "Serve the steak with the corn and zucchini and squeeze lime wedges over everything."
  ],
